Grammar

Rule 0     S' -> formula
Rule 1     formula -> formula AND formula
Rule 2     formula -> formula OR formula
Rule 3     formula -> formula IMPLIES formula
Rule 4     formula -> formula EQ formula
Rule 5     formula -> NOT formula
Rule 6     formula -> ( formula )
Rule 7     formula -> ID
Rule 8     formula -> TRUE
Rule 9     formula -> FALSE

Terminals, with rules where they appear

(                    : 6
)                    : 6
AND                  : 1
EQ                   : 4
FALSE                : 9
ID                   : 7
IMPLIES              : 3
NOT                  : 5
OR                   : 2
TRUE                 : 8
error                : 

Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

formula              : 1 1 2 2 3 3 4 4 5 6 0

Parsing method: LALR

